<title>BULGARIA: WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - APRIL 14-COLD, SNOW.</title>
<headline>WEATHER FORECAST - BULGARIA - APRIL 14-COLD, SNOW.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cold and cloudy across the country with strong northern winds in the northwest. Rain expected in the east, snow in the mountains, state radio said.</p>
<p>Maximum temperatures seen between 0 and 5 degrees, temperature in Sofia expected at about 5 degrees. -- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
